// This is the sheet's "Blink" (a Transmutation phase-shift defense buff), NOT the
// `CharacterAbility::Blink` teleport variant -- name collision only, different mechanic
// entirely. Sheet variant is SelfBuff and range is Self, so no touch-ally deviation needed here.
//
// "Attacks and effects pass harmlessly through" is literally full damage immunity
// (`BuffKind::Invulnerability`), but a full-immunity grant is a materially higher power level
// than a partial defensive buff and worth escalating on its own rather than bundling a second
// one alongside an existing unreviewed grant elsewhere in the school. `ProtectingWard` (partial,
// non-linear damage reduction) is used instead as the safer available defensive primitive.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.5, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 65.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Arcane), cooldown: Some(35.0)),
)
